                   "GEF": "angGEF", "HEF": "angHEF" },
        slides: [
            { text: "“If a straight line is set up at right angles to two straight lines”",
              visible: HYP,
              highlighted: ["EF","AB","CD","rtAEF","rtCEF"] },
            { text: "“which cut one another at their common point of section,”",
